{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35820","headline":"与刘三礼陈孝廉言志 · 李咸用","name":"与刘三礼陈孝廉言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真宰无私造化均，年年分散月中春。\n皆期早蹑青云路，谁肯长爲白社人。\n宋国高风休敛翼，圣朝公道易酬身。\n大须审固穿杨箭，莫遣参差鬓雪新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}